 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "For three years,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.135
  },
  {
   "text": "Jake dug for gold,",
   "s": 1.262,
   "e": 2.588
  },
  {
   "text": "and found nothing.",
   "s": 2.724,
   "e": 3.687
  },
  {
   "text": "So he did what desperate miners did.",
   "s": 4.271,
   "e": 6.13
  },
  {
   "text": "He salted the mine.",
   "s": 6.624,
   "e": 7.725
  },
  {
   "text": "He loaded a shotgun with gold dust, and blasted it into the rock.",
   "s": 8.243,
   "e": 11.577
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the walls sparkle.",
   "s": 12.089,
   "e": 13.369
  },
  {
   "text": "He nails up a sign.",
   "s": 14.014,
   "e": 14.921
  },
  {
   "text": "For sale.",
   "s": 15.365,
   "e": 15.914
  },
  {
   "text": "Rich vein.",
   "s": 16.193,
   "e": 16.895
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning, a millionaire rolls up in a shiny new car.",
   "s": 17.48,
   "e": 20.659
  },
  {
   "text": "And he brought an expert.",
   "s": 21.029,
   "e": 22.226
  },
  {
   "text": "The expert smashes a chunk of rock,",
   "s": 22.699,
   "e": 24.591
  },
  {
   "text": "swirls it in a pan,",
   "s": 24.789,
   "e": 25.972
  },
  {
   "text": "and squints.",
   "s": 26.139,
   "e": 26.899
  },
  {
   "text": "Gold flakes.",
   "s": 27.403,
   "e": 28.517
  },
  {
   "text": "Everywhere.",
   "s": 28.828,
   "e": 29.479
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 30.001,
   "e": 30.352
  },
  {
   "text": "salting worked because the gold was real.",
   "s": 30.5,
   "e": 32.715
  },
  {
   "text": "It just didn't come from that mine.",
   "s": 33.077,
   "e": 34.453
  },
  {
   "text": "The millionaire pays ten thousand dollars,",
   "s": 35.0,
   "e": 37.195
  },
  {
   "text": "cash.",
   "s": 37.425,
   "e": 37.911
  },
  {
   "text": "Jake and his partner run off laughing.",
   "s": 38.313,
   "e": 40.199
  },
  {
   "text": "They can't believe somebody fell for it.",
   "s": 40.453,
   "e": 42.323
  },
  {
   "text": "But the millionaire doesn't leave.",
   "s": 42.866,
   "e": 44.285
  },
  {
   "text": "He lights a stick of dynamite,",
   "s": 44.782,
   "e": 46.085
  },
  {
   "text": "tosses it at the back wall like a firecracker,",
   "s": 46.357,
   "e": 48.584
  },
  {
   "text": "and runs.",
   "s": 48.787,
   "e": 49.462
  },
  {
   "text": "Boom.",
   "s": 49.964,
   "e": 50.513
  },
  {
   "text": "When the dust clears,",
   "s": 51.191,
   "e": 52.191
  },
  {
   "text": "there it is.",
   "s": 52.438,
   "e": 53.139
  },
  {
   "text": "A vein of gold as thick as your arm.",
   "s": 53.509,
   "e": 55.699
  },
  {
   "text": "Jake had stopped digging ten feet too early.",
   "s": 56.172,
   "e": 58.55
  }
 ]
